{"channelId":"UCa11Y5lkd2zlZBxzZY2Vcbw","row":["Gulf Coast Veterinary Specialists",489,"At Gulf Coast Veterinary Specialists (GCVS), we’ve been a trusted leader in veterinary specialty and emergency care since 1988. Our Houston hospital is one of the nation’s largest specialty hospitals, with a team of more than 70 board-certified specialists and 350+ dedicated support staff are united in delivering exceptional care for pets and peace of mind for their families.\n\nIn the fall of 2025, we expanded to a second location in Webster, TX, to meet the growing demand for specialized and emergency veterinary care in the area.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa11Y5lkd2zlZBxzZY2Vcbw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa11Y5lkd2zlZBxzZY2Vcbw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:00.146Z","channelId":"UCa11Y5lkd2zlZBxzZY2Vcbw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"11da3cc777004de67d0e702d51765e1b25a8076d1d69c8b938f9431d75330819","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"24c79dee2224828bf115ed9086bcbda4e56a58d0f6a0845c06e04a96b93e4cf1"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa11Y5lkd2zlZBxzZY2Vcbw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:00.146Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa11Y5lkd2zlZBxzZY2Vcbw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":489,"raw":"489 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa11Y5lkd2zlZBxzZY2Vcbw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:00.146Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[{"url":"https://www.gcvs.com/contact-us","hasForm":false,"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:34:55.103Z"}],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCa11Y5lkd2zlZBxzZY2Vcbw"]},{"keyword":"veterinarian","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed